      <li>Post-training: SFT, LoRA, RLHF</li>
      <li>Distributed training: FSDP, DDP, tensor parallelism</li>
      <li>GPU kernels: Triton, CUDA</li>
      <li>Multi-agent orchestration and inference serving</li>
    </ul>

